Package: devjam-grub-tools
Version: 1.28-2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Grub boot items by devjam
 Extra GRUB menu entries: Rescuezilla, Clonezilla, Super GRUB2 Disk,
 a hardware info screen, booting ISO images from a boot-isos directory
 on the local or on any filesystem, and shutdown/reboot.
